# Direct dependencies of the deployed app. requirements.txt is generated from
# this file and pins every transitive package too, so a Docker build installs
# exactly what CI tested. To change a version, edit it here, then run:
#   make lock
# (uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.11 -o requirements.txt)

